+| open (nearest 3+ yd), depth | n | P believed / caught | pOpen x pClear / not defended | pAcc / not missed | hands / not dropped (of reached) |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 0-5 yd | 71 | 0.56 / 0.73 | 0.83 / 0.97 | 0.74 / 1.00 | 0.93 / 0.75 |
